OL,3,GNEWSAPostal counter service looking for
OL,4,Aa new home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe current central post office counter
OL,7,Fin the town of Ramsey is due to close
OL,8,Ffrom next year.
OL,10,FIsle of Man Post Office (IoMPO) has
OL,11,Fposted an expression of interest for
OL,12,Flocal businesses interested in taking
OL,13,Fover the running of the contract from 1
OL,14,FFebruary 2027 until 31 March 2028 with
OL,15,Fan option to extend for a further 12
OL,16,Fmonths.
OL,18,FThe closure will fall in line with the
OL,19,Fending of the Spar store in Parliament
OL,20,FStreet, which currently offers the
OL,21,Fcounter service.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,449,445,260,140,0,100
