OL,3,GNEWSAPostal counter service looking for
OL,4,Aa new home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said: "For operational
OL,7,Freasons, Mannin Retail has made the
OL,8,Fdifficult decision to close the Spar
OL,9,FRamsey Parliament Street store,
OL,10,Fincluding the Post Office. The store
OL,11,Fwill close on 30 January 2027."
